WEBVTT

00:00:53.090 --> 00:00:55.770
Good morning, young master.

00:01:10.340 --> 00:01:15.340
<b>The Maid I Hired Recently
Is Mysterious</b>

00:02:29.540 --> 00:02:33.290
<b>Episode 2:      The Young Master, the Cat, and the Morning Glory</b>

00:02:35.970 --> 00:02:39.040
Young master, your clothing.

00:02:40.280 --> 00:02:44.200
I'll be waiting with your breakfast ready.

00:02:49.590 --> 00:02:52.020
New clothes again.

00:03:02.750 --> 00:03:05.630
<i>I've gotten pretty used 
to living with Lilith.</i>

00:03:06.110 --> 00:03:06.880
<i>But...</i>

00:03:07.860 --> 00:03:11.110
<i>Something's still suspicious about her.</i>

00:03:13.370 --> 00:03:14.720
Man...

00:03:15.690 --> 00:03:17.510
It's so hot.

00:03:21.100 --> 00:03:22.830
It's meunière today, huh?

00:03:28.660 --> 00:03:29.860
Delicious!

00:03:32.000 --> 00:03:33.460
I will answer it.

00:03:36.100 --> 00:03:38.540
<i>Who could be here so early in the morning?</i>

00:03:46.150 --> 00:03:49.710
It's the new model that's 
always out of stock!

00:03:52.280 --> 00:03:53.910
Why is this here?

00:03:54.160 --> 00:03:56.370
Is it to your liking?

00:03:59.700 --> 00:04:01.490
<i>The new clothes...</i>

00:04:02.430 --> 00:04:03.880
<i>The pants from this morning...</i>

00:04:04.680 --> 00:04:07.010
<i>And this game console...</i>

00:04:07.770 --> 00:04:10.930
<i>Why is she suddenly giving 
me all kinds of stuff?!</i>

00:04:10.930 --> 00:04:12.310
<i>This is suspicious!</i>

00:04:12.590 --> 00:04:14.990
What are you trying to 
do by giving me things?

00:04:15.350 --> 00:04:18.190
All things I want, too.

00:04:18.190 --> 00:04:20.330
As a maid, I...

00:04:20.330 --> 00:04:21.230
I see.

00:04:21.230 --> 00:04:23.840
You're trying to control 
me by giving me stuff.

00:04:25.160 --> 00:04:27.530
Yes, that's correct.

00:04:28.460 --> 00:04:33.280
I'll tame you and make you mine.

00:04:35.240 --> 00:04:36.920
What would you do if I said that?

00:04:39.660 --> 00:04:42.410
You're never going to tame me.

00:04:43.060 --> 00:04:45.540
I'm not going to do as you please!

00:04:46.490 --> 00:04:50.880
I don't need to be baited with things 
to know that you're attractive.

00:04:50.880 --> 00:04:53.050
Don't underestimate me 
just because I'm a child!

00:04:53.740 --> 00:04:56.130
I'm going to be the one to make <i>you</i> mine!

00:04:56.130 --> 00:04:57.520
U-Um...

00:04:57.780 --> 00:05:00.310
You're going to be mine!

00:05:03.490 --> 00:05:04.530
More, please.

00:05:06.370 --> 00:05:08.580
U-Understood.

00:05:11.790 --> 00:05:16.290
<b>The Maid I Hired Recently
Is Mysterious</b>

00:05:12.990 --> 00:05:15.910
<i>The Maid I Hired Recently Is Mysterious</i>.

00:05:24.010 --> 00:05:26.950
I've made tea, young master.

00:05:26.950 --> 00:05:27.630
Okay.

00:05:32.160 --> 00:05:35.520
I've baked some pastries, young master.

00:05:35.520 --> 00:05:36.800
Would you like to try them?

00:05:36.800 --> 00:05:37.610
Yeah.

00:05:40.740 --> 00:05:43.430
Young master, is there 
anything you're stuck on?

00:05:43.560 --> 00:05:46.440
Young master, shall I sharpen your pencil?

00:05:46.580 --> 00:05:49.400
Young master, would you like some more tea?

00:05:49.520 --> 00:05:50.510
Young master...

00:05:51.790 --> 00:05:53.700
Shut up!

00:05:53.700 --> 00:05:55.790
What's going on with you?!

00:05:55.790 --> 00:05:59.400
What are you trying to accomplish 
by interfering with my studying?!

00:05:59.400 --> 00:06:01.400
My apologies.

00:06:01.400 --> 00:06:05.440
I just want to make myself 
as useful to you as I can.

00:06:06.600 --> 00:06:08.570
You're going to distract me either way.

00:06:08.950 --> 00:06:11.300
You might as well stay 
next to me while I study.

00:06:11.790 --> 00:06:13.670
That'll keep you from getting lonely, right?

00:06:19.900 --> 00:06:23.120
It wasn't that I was lonely at all.

00:06:28.200 --> 00:06:32.700
<b>The Maid I Hired Recently
Is Mysterious</b>

00:06:29.280 --> 00:06:32.430
<i><i>The Maid I Hired Recently Is Mysterious</i>.</i>

00:06:34.920 --> 00:06:38.570
Come to think of it, 
Lilith has been gone a while.

00:06:39.210 --> 00:06:41.250
My apologies, young master.

00:06:41.250 --> 00:06:43.510
I'll be leaving for a moment.

00:06:43.510 --> 00:06:44.970
Okay, got it.

00:06:48.600 --> 00:06:49.630
All right.

00:07:08.340 --> 00:07:10.200
<i>Way too suspicious!</i>

00:07:10.200 --> 00:07:12.440
<i>Why is she so restless?</i>

00:07:13.090 --> 00:07:14.550
<i>The backyard?</i>

00:07:14.550 --> 00:07:17.770
<i>What business does she have in the backyard?</i>

00:07:20.970 --> 00:07:23.180
<i>There must be some kind of secret.</i>

00:07:23.760 --> 00:07:26.040
<i>Today's the day I find out.</i>

00:07:34.960 --> 00:07:37.270
<i>She's been playing with a stray cat?</i>

00:07:37.270 --> 00:07:39.060
Meow.

00:07:41.370 --> 00:07:43.880
<i>I never knew she could make such a face.</i>

00:07:45.500 --> 00:07:46.910
Oh, young master.

00:07:47.760 --> 00:07:49.790
Would you like to pet it, too?

00:07:50.250 --> 00:07:53.250
This kitty is very calm and friendly.

00:07:53.730 --> 00:07:55.100
No, I'll pass.

00:07:56.560 --> 00:07:57.990
You will?

00:07:58.380 --> 00:08:00.750
But it's so adorable.

00:08:04.690 --> 00:08:08.340
Could it be that you'd 
like me to pet you, too?

00:08:08.340 --> 00:08:09.930
Of course not!

00:08:09.930 --> 00:08:11.770
I'm just afraid of cats!

00:08:11.770 --> 00:08:12.880
Besides...

00:08:12.880 --> 00:08:15.100
You're even cuter!

00:08:16.950 --> 00:08:22.850
I couldn't help but admire how beautifully 
picturesque you were petting the cat.

00:08:23.260 --> 00:08:27.000
But I couldn't come closer 
because I'm afraid of cats!

00:08:30.320 --> 00:08:32.830
What is it so happy about?

00:08:32.830 --> 00:08:36.240
Young master, that only applies to dogs.

00:08:36.240 --> 00:08:38.600
This cat is indicating that it's angry.

00:08:38.940 --> 00:08:42.350
It seems to have been 
startled by your voice.

00:08:44.930 --> 00:08:47.410
What's the matter, young master?

00:08:48.490 --> 00:08:50.500
I want to get over my fear of cats.

00:08:53.590 --> 00:08:54.850
I see.

00:08:56.250 --> 00:08:58.590
Then I shall help.

00:08:58.850 --> 00:09:02.010
Lilith, I'm the master of this mansion.

00:09:02.320 --> 00:09:04.350
I can handle it myself.

00:09:06.160 --> 00:09:07.650
Understood.

00:09:07.990 --> 00:09:10.760
Then I shall be in the mansion.

00:09:10.760 --> 00:09:13.030
Please let me know if you need anything.

00:09:28.280 --> 00:09:29.490
That's it!

00:09:39.630 --> 00:09:41.050
One more time.

00:09:56.400 --> 00:09:57.490
Young master.

00:09:58.280 --> 00:10:00.190
Lilith. What is it?

00:10:00.430 --> 00:10:04.200
I kept some of the fish from 
breakfast for the cat.

00:10:04.880 --> 00:10:07.440
I'm about to leave to go shopping.

00:10:07.440 --> 00:10:10.420
Could you please feed it in my place?

00:10:10.810 --> 00:10:11.800
All right.

00:10:12.170 --> 00:10:13.460
Leave it to me.

00:10:13.780 --> 00:10:16.430
Thank you, young master.

00:10:20.220 --> 00:10:21.330
<i>Okay.</i>

00:10:28.940 --> 00:10:31.000
D-Do you like it?

00:10:32.520 --> 00:10:34.430
<i>I wonder if I can touch it now.</i>

00:10:50.200 --> 00:10:54.090
<i>Is it trying to protect me?</i>

00:11:10.880 --> 00:11:13.690
Th-That was scary.

00:11:26.620 --> 00:11:29.350
I hope the young master is all right.

00:11:31.870 --> 00:11:33.400
Oh... Young master...

00:11:37.370 --> 00:11:38.840
Look, Lilith!

00:11:38.840 --> 00:11:41.410
I can touch cats now.

00:11:41.700 --> 00:11:44.890
That's an amazing improvement 
in such a short time.

00:11:44.890 --> 00:11:46.220
Of course.

00:11:46.220 --> 00:11:49.300
I'm the master of this mansion, after all.

00:11:49.740 --> 00:11:50.880
There, there.

00:11:51.150 --> 00:11:52.680
There, there.

00:11:52.680 --> 00:11:53.770
Good kitty.

00:11:54.590 --> 00:11:57.010
You're so soft to the touch.

00:11:58.620 --> 00:12:00.220
You're so cute.

00:12:00.660 --> 00:12:03.290
Young master, w-would you...

00:12:04.160 --> 00:12:06.300
Would you pet...

00:12:07.780 --> 00:12:09.410
Never mind.

00:12:10.890 --> 00:12:14.050
Good for you, getting petted
by the young master.

00:12:16.570 --> 00:12:18.460
Y-Young master?

00:12:18.460 --> 00:12:20.830
You're soft to the touch, too.

00:12:25.790 --> 00:12:27.600
I should make lunch.

00:12:27.600 --> 00:12:29.850
I'll be back inside.

00:12:30.760 --> 00:12:33.140
Hey, you dropped something.

00:12:35.150 --> 00:12:38.260
Wh-Why do you have a photo of me?!

00:12:40.820 --> 00:12:43.050
You caught me.

00:12:43.680 --> 00:12:49.680
It's just something I secretly keep with me 
so I can always see my adorable master.

00:12:50.030 --> 00:12:52.490
Why don't you look at the real thing, then?

00:12:53.630 --> 00:12:56.130
I won't run or hide.

00:12:59.180 --> 00:13:00.640
Why are you running?

00:13:03.860 --> 00:13:05.770
Is this a sneak photo?

00:13:06.600 --> 00:13:07.640
Wait...

00:13:13.070 --> 00:13:15.300
<i>Is it for some curse?!</i>

00:13:16.630 --> 00:13:20.280
<i>There's definitely something 
suspicious about her.</i>

00:13:32.690 --> 00:13:36.540
Young master, lunch is ready.

00:13:36.540 --> 00:13:38.840
Okay. I'll be right there.

00:13:39.310 --> 00:13:42.850
Your morning glory bloomed beautifully.

00:13:43.190 --> 00:13:44.160
Yeah.

00:13:44.160 --> 00:13:46.880
I've been watering it every day.

00:13:47.920 --> 00:13:49.330
I'm not showing you yet.

00:13:49.720 --> 00:13:50.700
Yet?

00:13:51.290 --> 00:13:53.880
Okay, let's have lunch now.

00:13:53.880 --> 00:13:55.650
Young master...

00:13:56.870 --> 00:13:58.270
Let's eat.

00:14:05.940 --> 00:14:07.010
<i>Delicious.</i>

00:14:07.010 --> 00:14:08.930
<i>Way too delicious!</i>

00:14:15.510 --> 00:14:17.980
<i>There must be some secret.</i>

00:14:17.980 --> 00:14:19.050
<i>There must be...</i>

00:14:21.040 --> 00:14:21.950
Young master?

00:14:22.270 --> 00:14:25.350
Lilith, teach me how to cook.

00:14:26.260 --> 00:14:29.090
But I want to make your meals for you.

00:14:29.470 --> 00:14:31.600
I want to learn how to cook.

00:14:31.900 --> 00:14:32.920
My.

00:14:33.190 --> 00:14:35.550
<i>She distracted me the last time I asked.</i>

00:14:36.250 --> 00:14:38.800
I put a love potion in it.

00:14:40.660 --> 00:14:43.760
<i>But today, I'm going to find out.</i>

00:14:44.640 --> 00:14:50.640
Could it be that you want me to teach you, 
hand in hand, step by step?

00:14:53.370 --> 00:14:54.350
That's right.

00:14:54.350 --> 00:14:58.370
Your dishes are better than 
anything I've ever had.

00:14:59.170 --> 00:15:01.740
I want to eat your cooking every day.

00:15:01.740 --> 00:15:04.610
In fact, I want to marry you.

00:15:04.950 --> 00:15:05.840
Marry...

00:15:06.050 --> 00:15:09.290
So I want to be sure I know 
how to cook like you.

00:15:10.330 --> 00:15:14.530
Shall we make your favorite stew, then?

00:15:14.530 --> 00:15:16.600
Stew, huh? Sounds good!

00:15:24.420 --> 00:15:27.420
Shall we cut the vegetables first?

00:15:27.420 --> 00:15:28.400
Okay.

00:15:31.480 --> 00:15:33.900
Young master, curl your left hand.

00:15:33.900 --> 00:15:35.360
Hold it like a cat's paw.

00:15:35.360 --> 00:15:37.290
Don't tense up. Slowly.

00:15:38.700 --> 00:15:40.660
There. That's good.

00:15:43.980 --> 00:15:49.080
It's like I'm embracing 
you right now, isn't it?

00:15:49.850 --> 00:15:51.400
Did you say something?

00:15:51.400 --> 00:15:53.840
Young master, mind your hand!

00:15:54.120 --> 00:15:56.050
It's your fault for talking to me.

00:15:56.510 --> 00:15:58.760
My apologies.

00:15:58.760 --> 00:16:00.470
What do I do next?

00:16:00.470 --> 00:16:02.130
Next...

00:16:35.520 --> 00:16:38.580
It's pretty good for my 
first time, isn't it?

00:16:38.580 --> 00:16:40.940
Very impressive, young master.

00:16:40.940 --> 00:16:43.010
Aren't you going to sit down, Lilith?

00:16:43.440 --> 00:16:45.080
U-Um...

00:16:45.530 --> 00:16:48.470
Are you sure I may join you?

00:16:48.470 --> 00:16:50.260
Yeah, of course.

00:16:50.260 --> 00:16:51.590
Let's eat together.

00:16:51.590 --> 00:16:54.110
Then, with your permission...

00:16:55.140 --> 00:16:56.780
Let's eat.

00:16:59.010 --> 00:17:03.090
<i>She didn't put anything 
suspicious in it, though.</i>

00:17:06.890 --> 00:17:09.010
It's delicious, young master.

00:17:09.490 --> 00:17:10.930
It's okay.

00:17:10.930 --> 00:17:12.790
It's very delicious.

00:17:13.030 --> 00:17:15.890
No, it doesn't taste the same as usual.

00:17:15.890 --> 00:17:18.250
Are you sure it's the same recipe?

00:17:18.530 --> 00:17:22.590
It tastes better to me than usual.

00:17:23.460 --> 00:17:26.640
I may have forgotten a secret ingredient.

00:17:27.340 --> 00:17:28.480
I knew it!

00:17:29.250 --> 00:17:32.310
I always use plenty of it.

00:17:32.310 --> 00:17:36.310
The secret ingredient is my 
love for my young master.

00:17:36.310 --> 00:17:37.030
Just kiddi—

00:17:37.030 --> 00:17:39.020
I see! It's love!

00:17:39.240 --> 00:17:45.410
It makes me happy because you make it 
just for me, with my happiness in mind.

00:17:48.160 --> 00:17:49.130
Wait...

00:17:49.390 --> 00:17:51.860
The reason why the mansion 
is always so spotless,

00:17:51.860 --> 00:17:56.210
and why my torn clothes are 
suddenly in perfect shape...

00:17:56.210 --> 00:17:58.960
Is it all because you're full of love for me?

00:18:03.060 --> 00:18:04.180
Yes.

00:18:04.180 --> 00:18:05.190
Amazing!

00:18:05.460 --> 00:18:08.070
How are you able to have 
so much love all the time?

00:18:12.240 --> 00:18:15.690
That's a secret for now.

00:18:22.860 --> 00:18:25.380
This was a long day.

00:18:28.140 --> 00:18:31.060
It was a good day, though.

00:18:38.450 --> 00:18:39.140
Hm?

00:18:39.130 --> 00:18:46.140
The flowers bloomed.
They're a pretty color, 
like Lilith's eyes.

00:18:50.040 --> 00:18:51.430
<i>Hang on...</i>

00:18:51.430 --> 00:18:55.050
<i>How did she know I love stew?</i>

00:19:02.270 --> 00:19:04.600
You must be exhausted after today.

00:19:04.600 --> 00:19:06.520
Please get plenty of rest tonight.

00:19:07.710 --> 00:19:11.090
Well, goodnight, young master.

00:19:11.400 --> 00:19:12.790
Goodnight.

00:19:16.520 --> 00:19:20.410
<i>When does Lilith ever sleep?</i>

00:19:20.880 --> 00:19:27.590
<i>It seems like she's working before 
I wake up and after I go to sleep.</i>

00:19:29.690 --> 00:19:31.180
<i>Suspicious!</i>

00:19:32.010 --> 00:19:35.620
<i>She must be doing something really 
suspicious while I'm asleep,</i>

00:19:35.620 --> 00:19:38.180
<i>something she can't tell me about.</i>

00:19:48.720 --> 00:19:51.320
<i>Today's the day I stay up and find out.</i>

00:20:16.720 --> 00:20:18.120
Lilith...

00:20:18.810 --> 00:20:22.440
Why do you always go to sleep after me?

00:20:23.570 --> 00:20:29.830
So that I can sneak a look at your 
endearing face when you're asleep.

00:20:48.810 --> 00:20:52.260
Sleep well, young master.

00:23:18.960 --> 00:23:23.950
<b>Next Time
Episode 3: Gojouin Tsukasa Is Precocious</b>
